    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "In a primary election result that fractured party unity, the contender who challenged party order won a majority of votes in the runoff. This followed a presidential endorsement from the nation's leader, benefiting from a top-down power play. The stage is now set for a battle over national legislative control in the general election.",
